# Django Models

- Fat models, thin views. Domain rules live on the model or a custom QuerySet.
- `select_related` for FK/O2O; `prefetch_related` for M2M and reverse FKs.
- `.exists()` / `.count()` instead of truthiness or `len()`.
- Review generated migrations before applying. Data migrations use `apps.get_model()`.
- Prefer model methods over signals for business logic.

See skill: `django-models`.
